Camera, to snap a photo of Dr. Spanko while

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:15.870
he was eating a plate of gummy worms in the
center of his enclosure, and this was the

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:16.870
result:

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:17.870
"Inconclusive.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:22.730
Dr. Naismith, who supervised the test, later
remarked the presence of a human face resembling

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.410
